    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Exclusions",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<ul><li>International Flights (either side of tour).</li><li>Visas - an entry visa is required.  It is the travelers responsibility to ensure they’re holding a current visa for the countries they’re visiting. Tour assistants may be able to help secure your visa at the Cairo airport depending on your country of<br/>origin.</li><li>Tipping & gratuities</li><li>Personal Expenses / Optional Activities</li><li>Travelers Insurance</li><li>Laundry services</li><li>Any additional/optional services or tours not mentioned in the itinerary above.</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Reservation and Payment",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>To secure your booking, full payment for the reservation will be required at the time of booking. Please note that your booking will only be considered confirmed once the payment has been received.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "88fe273d-dad8-4fcb-8e72-e298aeffea83": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Cancellation and Refunds",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Given the complex nature of coordinating travel, we understand that cancellations may occur.</p><ol><li>All cancellations must be made in writing.</li><li>Cancellations made before February 7, 2024 will receive a full refund.</li><li>Cancellations made between February 8, 2024 and February 22, 2024 will result in a refund of 50% of the full cost per person.</li><li>Cancellations received between February 23, 2024 and March 8, 2024 will incur a refund of 25% per Person.</li><li>Cancellations made after March 8, 2024 will not be eligible for a refund.</li></ol><p>Please note that no refunds will be provided for unused services, including but not limited to transfers, city tours, accommodations, meals, or transportation that are not availed voluntarily.</p><p>We understand that unforeseen circumstances can arise, and we highly recommend that travelers consider travel insurance to safeguard their investment in the event of unexpected changes. Thank you for your understanding of our policy, as it ensures the smooth operation and the satisfaction of all parties involved.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8fef7e85-3dbd-4573-b556-4afbf969813d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Waiver of Responsibility",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>By signing up to the Tour you agree to our Terms (as detailed in the \"Things to Know\" section herein), Cancellation and Refunds policy and Waiver. Guide of Egypt & its agents Saba Tours have worked diligently to make all the arrangements for our journey together in Egypt. However, Guide of Egypt & its agents Saba Tours and Gaia will not be held liable for delays, theft, damage, injury, or any other irregularities that may occur during the journey. We will not be held liable for any changes or delays in airline schedules or missed connections; injury, loss, or damage to persons or property; additional expenses resulting from changes in exchange rates, tariffs, or itinerary; any transportation issues or problems with vehicles utilized on the tour; additional expenses incurred due to illness, weather conditions, protests, war, terrorism, quarantine, or other causes; and losses due to cancellations not subject to our Terms and Conditions.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab07": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Changes",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>This Itinerary is subject to changes to adapt to possible alterations in domestic flight times or other unforeseen circumstances. The content will remain the same, barring any unanticipated complications, and will include many delightful “extras” and surprises.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Insurance",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We highly recommend that all participants obtain travel insurance. Travel Insured International offers insurance for trip cost, trip cancellation & interruption, and pays for loss due to unforeseen circumstance, death, injury, or illness to you or a member of your family. It also includes coverage for missed connections due to weather, pays for lost deposits due to the financial default of the airline, the tour operator, or cruise line. It pays for baggage delays, travel delays, medical expenses and emergency assistance.</p>",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
